B.aeO=new A.cO("C\xe9lulas madre","C\xe9lulas no especializadas capaces de autorrenovarse y diferenciarse en uno o m\xe1s tipos de c\xe9lulas especializadas. Las pluripotentes pueden originar casi todos los tipos celulares del cuerpo; muchas c\xe9lulas madre adultas producen tipos celulares propios de su tejido.","Unspecialized cells able to self-renew and differentiate into one or more specialized cell types. Pluripotent cells can generate nearly all body cell types, while many adult stem cells produce cell types belonging to their tissue.")
B.aeF=new A.cO("Placas de Peyer","Conjuntos organizados de fol\xedculos linfoides situados principalmente en la mucosa y submucosa del \xedleon, en el intestino delgado. Forman parte del tejido linfoide asociado al intestino: captan ant\xedgenos mediante c\xe9lulas M y ayudan a iniciar respuestas inmunitarias de la mucosa, incluida la producci\xf3n de inmunoglobulina A (IgA).","Organized clusters of lymphoid follicles located mainly in the mucosa and submucosa of the ileum in the small intestine. They are part of gut-associated lymphoid tissue: M cells sample antigens and help initiate mucosal immune responses, including immunoglobulin A (IgA) production.")
B.aeR=new A.cO("Factor de transferencia","Mensajeros inmunol\xf3gicos presentes en fuentes naturales que ayudan a educar y respaldar la respuesta del sistema inmunol\xf3gico.","Immune messenger molecules found in natural sources that help educate and support immune system response.")
B.af1=new A.cO("Transfer Factor","Nombre usado para describir los componentes de respaldo inmunol\xf3gico caracter\xedsticos de varios productos 4Life.","The name used to describe the immune-support components found in several 4Life products.")
B.af9=new A.cO("Tri-Factor Formula","F\xf3rmula 4Life que combina componentes de reconocimiento, respuesta y memoria inmunol\xf3gica.","A 4Life formula that combines components related to immune recognition, response, and memory.")
B.afn=new A.cO("UltraFactor","Parte de la tecnolog\xeda Tri-Factor orientada al respaldo de la respuesta inmunol\xf3gica.","Part of Tri-Factor technology focused on supporting immune response.")
B.aff=new A.cO("OvoFactor","Componente derivado de yema de huevo usado como fuente de factores de transferencia.","An egg-yolk-derived component used as a source of transfer factors.")
B.af0=new A.cO("NanoFactor","Componente de la tecnolog\xeda Tri-Factor asociado al respaldo de comunicaci\xf3n inmunol\xf3gica.","A Tri-Factor technology component associated with immune communication support.")
B.af2=new A.cO("Calostro bovino","Primer fluido nutritivo producido por la vaca despu\xe9s del parto; contiene prote\xednas y compuestos de apoyo inmunol\xf3gico.","The first nutrient-rich fluid produced by a cow after birth; it contains proteins and immune-support compounds.")
B.aeX=new A.cO("Yema de huevo","Fuente natural usada en algunos productos para aportar componentes nutricionales y factores de transferencia.","A natural source used in some products to provide nutritional components and transfer factors.")
B.af5=new A.cO("P\xe9ptidos bioactivos","Fragmentos peque\xf1os de prote\xedna que pueden participar en funciones de bienestar y comunicaci\xf3n celular.","Small protein fragments that may participate in wellness functions and cellular communication.")
B.af3=new A.cO("Sistema inmunol\xf3gico","Red de c\xe9lulas, tejidos y \xf3rganos que ayuda al cuerpo a defenderse y mantener equilibrio interno.","The network of cells, tissues, and organs that helps the body defend itself and maintain internal balance.")
B.afl=new A.cO("Respaldo inmunol\xf3gico","Apoyo nutricional dirigido a mantener las funciones normales de defensa del cuerpo.","Nutritional support aimed at maintaining the body\u2019s normal defense functions.")
B.afa=new A.cO("Defensas naturales","Capacidades propias del cuerpo para responder ante desaf\xedos y conservar bienestar.","The body\u2019s own abilities to respond to challenges and preserve wellness.")
B.aeM=new A.cO("C\xe9lulas NK","C\xe9lulas Natural Killer, un tipo de c\xe9lula inmunol\xf3gica que participa en la vigilancia natural del organismo.","Natural Killer cells, a type of immune cell involved in the body\u2019s natural surveillance.")
B.aeI=new A.cO("Antioxidantes","Compuestos que ayudan a proteger las c\xe9lulas frente al estr\xe9s oxidativo.","Compounds that help protect cells from oxidative stress.")
B.af4=new A.cO("Bioflavonoides","Compuestos vegetales asociados con actividad antioxidante y bienestar general.","Plant compounds associated with antioxidant activity and general wellness.")
B.aeL=new A.cO("Superfrutas","Frutas reconocidas por su concentraci\xf3n de antioxidantes, vitaminas y fitonutrientes.","Fruits known for their concentration of antioxidants, vitamins, and phytonutrients.")
B.afb=new A.cO("A\xe7a\xed","Fruta amaz\xf3nica rica en fitonutrientes y antioxidantes.","An Amazonian fruit rich in phytonutrients and antioxidants.")
B.afi=new A.cO("Granada","Fruta con compuestos antioxidantes que apoyan el bienestar celular.","A fruit with antioxidant compounds that support cellular wellness.")
B.aeN=new A.cO("Ar\xe1ndano","Baya fuente de antioxidantes y fitonutrientes.","A berry that provides antioxidants and phytonutrients.")
B.aeY=new A.cO("Baya de sa\xfaco","Fruta tradicionalmente asociada al respaldo de bienestar estacional.","A berry traditionally associated with seasonal wellness support.")
B.afp=new A.cO("Vitamina C","Vitamina antioxidante que contribuye al funcionamiento normal del sistema inmunol\xf3gico.","An antioxidant vitamin that contributes to normal immune system function.")
